{
	"name": "木棍与石头",
	"category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
	"icon": "tfg:flint_arrow_head",
	"pages": [
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "在$(tfg)中，你最先能获得的东西是木棍、树枝、燧石和石子。它们几乎遍布各种气候，散落在地面上。$(item)$(k:key.use)$()或破坏它们即可拾取。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:multiblock",
			"multiblock": {
				"pattern": [
					[
						"     ",
						"     ",
						"  0  ",
						"     ",
						"     "
					],
					[
						"1    ",
						" 2  4",
						"   3 ",
						" 4   ",
						"6   5"
					],
					[
						"GGGGG",
						"GGGGG",
						"GGGGG",
						"GGGGG",
						"GGGGG"
					]
				],
				"mapping": {
					"G": "tfc:grass/sandy_loam",
					"1": "tfc:rock/loose/limestone[count=1]",
					"2": "tfc:rock/loose/limestone[count=2]",
					"3": "tfc:rock/loose/dolomite[count=3]",
					"4": "tfc:groundcover/stick",
					"5": "#tfc:twigs",
					"6": "tfc:groundcover/flint"
				}
			},
			"name": "示例",
			"text": "一些散落的木棍和石头。",
			"enable_visualize": false
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"anchor": "knapping",
			"text": "除了在地上收集木棍和树枝之外，用拳头打落树叶也能获得木棍。当你有了若干石子和木棍后，就可以开始$(thing)石子塑形$()了。石子塑形是把两块石头相互敲击、敲出特定形状的过程。要进行塑形，先手持至少两块石子，再对空右击，即可打开$(thing)塑形界面$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:image",
			"images": [
				"tfc:textures/gui/book/gui/rock_knapping.png"
			],
			"text": "塑形界面。",
			"border": false
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "要塑形出特定物品，你需要用$(item)$(k:key.attack)$()点击移除方格，直到形成想要的图案。例如，按照右侧所示配方拼出图案即可做出刀刃。$(br2)和合成配方一样，图案所在的位置不影响产出，而且有些配方存在多种有效变体。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:rock_knapping_recipe",
			"anchor": "knife",
			"recipes": [
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_knife_head",
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_knife_head_1",
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_knife_head_2",
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_knife_head_3"
			],
			"text": "一把石刀刃，用各种不同的岩石都可以制作。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "flint",
			"title": "燧石塑形",
			"item": "gtceu:flint_hoe_head,gtceu:flint_knife_head,gtceu:flint_shovel_head,gtceu:flint_axe_head,gtceu:flint_sword_head,tfg:flint_club_head,tfg:flint_arrow_head",
			"text": "燧石可以用来制作大多数能用石头塑出的物品，还能制作箭头这类独有的物品。燧石制品的数值通常远胜石头制品。查看河底和湖底有没有散落的燧石，就能轻松找到燧石。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"recipe": "gtceu:shaped/knife_stone",
			"text": "所有石头工具头都可以与木棍、树枝、骨头或其他棒状物合成，组装成工具。$(br2)石刀可以用来打割草类，采集$(thing)干草$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:rock_knapping_recipe",
			"recipes": [
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_axe_head"
			],
			"text": "$(thing)斧头$()可以砍倒整棵树，包括原木和树叶。要获得$(l:the_world/wild_fruits#fruit_trees)果树树苗$()就必须使用斧头。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:rock_knapping_recipe",
			"recipes": [
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_shovel_head"
			],
			"text": "$(thing)铲$()可以用来挖类似土壤材质的方块。对$(thing)草方块$()或$(thing)泥土$(item)使用$()铲子也可以制造$(thing)土径$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:rock_knapping_recipe",
			"recipes": [
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_hoe_head",
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_hoe_head_1",
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_hoe_head_2"
			],
			"text": "$(thing)锄头$()是$(l:agriculture/growing_crops)耕种$()的实用工具，但它也能像刀一样割除树叶和其他植物。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:rock_knapping_recipe",
			"recipes": [
				"tfg:rock_knapping/stone_hammer_head"
			],
			"text": "$(thing)锤子$()可以用作$(l:game_mechanics/damage_types)打击$()武器，但它更重要的用途是$(l:craftsmanship/anvils)锻造$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:rock_knapping_recipe",
			"recipes": [
				"tfc:rock_knapping/javelin_head_sedimentary",
				"tfc:rock_knapping/javelin_head_metamorphic",
				"tfc:rock_knapping/javelin_head_igneous_extrusive",
				"tfc:rock_knapping/javelin_head_igneous_intrusive"
			],
			"text": "最后，$(thing)标枪$()是一种原始武器，可以掷向目标，也可以作为$(l:game_mechanics/damage_types)突刺$()武器使用。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:relations",
			"title": "延伸阅读",
			"anchor": "relations",
			"entries": [
				"tfg:the_world/wild_fruits",
				"tfg:agriculture/growing_crops",
				"tfg:the_world/earth_tree_index",
				"tfg:the_world/geology",
				"tfg:craftsmanship/pottery",
				"tfg:craftsmanship/metallurgy"
			]
		}
	],
